<title>UK: Halifax adds 200 mln stg to May 2021 bond.</title>
<headline>Halifax adds 200 mln stg to May 2021 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HALIFAX BUILDING SOCIETY</p>
<p> AMT  **200 MLN STG   COUPON     9.375     MATURITY    15.MAY.21</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  *	   PAY DATE  **07.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    *	   SPREAD	+80 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** FUNGIBLE WITH 300 MLN STG BOND LAUNCHED ON 01.MAY.96</p>
<p>		PAYDATE PLUS 98 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>	    * TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  U.K.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  0.00	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.0 PCT 2021 GILT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
